  "fullDescription": "Distressed Sherlock is an elegant serif font that combines classic letterforms with a beautiful distressed texture, creating a timeless and sophisticated look. This font is designed to bring a vintage yet luxurious feel to your designs while still maintaining clarity and readability.\n\nWith its unique ligatures and stylistic alternates, Distressed Sherlock allows you to create elegant typography with a custom-made feel. The distressed details add character and texture, making it perfect for projects that need a classic, editorial, and vintage aesthetic.\n\nThis font is perfect for branding, logos, editorial layouts, magazines, packaging, wedding invitations, quotes, posters, book covers, and luxury branding projects.",
